## SQ-AC-02 | dragon set 36 armor, 18 toughness
@group server
@commands Give a bot player the full dragon set (helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots) and equip it; `/attribute <bot> minecraft:generic.armor get`
@pass 36 (was 30)
@fails mixin not applied, or config `[dragon_gear] armorCap` below 36
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-3, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1101 p1_server / r1031 a1_world, a2_variants bot row
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> item replace entity qa armor.head with dragonloot:dragon_helmet
> item replace entity qa armor.chest with dragonloot:dragon_chestplate
> item replace entity qa armor.legs with dragonloot:dragon_leggings
> item replace entity qa armor.feet with dragonloot:dragon_boots
sleep 2
> attribute qa minecraft:generic.armor get
> attribute qa minecraft:generic.armor_toughness get
expect for entity qa is 36
expect armor_toughness for entity qa is 18
> clear qa

